hat one skill (Wilderness itself prints None). Physical except Boxing and Body Building (Body Building & Weight Lifting). Science: Math only, both Mathematics rows. SECONDARY: printed two at levels 1, 5 and 10, read as two at level one and two more at 5 and 10. || BONUSES: +1 attack, +1 strike, +2 parry, +2 dodge, +4 roll stored. +1D4+2 save vs magic is a dice roll and is ability text, not stored. +5% manual-dexterity skills is ability text. || EQUIPMENT: catalog rows clothing (durable clothes, often a utility jumpsuit), utility-belt, backpack, sleeping-bag, survival-knife, canteen, e-clip x1D4. One weapon for each W.P. is the player''s pick. Not stored, no catalog row: pouches, basic personal items, sweets and salty snacks. || MONEY: 3D6x100 credits stored; another 2D4x1,000 credits in tradeable or Black Market items is prose. || NOT STORED: size 3-4 ft, weight 50-80 lbs, life span 3D6+75 years, NPC experience level 1D6, habitat, allies and enemies; they are in GM Notes."
